      "title_at_revision": "Minimum flight crew.",
      "text": "The minimum flight crew must be established so that it is sufficient for safe operation, considering--\n(a) The workload on individual crewmembers;\n(b) The accessibility and ease of operation of necessary controls by the appropriate crewmember; and\n(c) The kinds of operation authorized under Sec. 29.1525.",
